&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intelligent Document Processing (IDP) platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OCR, document understanding, semantic search, or enterprise content management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud-based AI platforms such as Azure AI, AWS AI, or Google AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explainable AI frameworks and model governance practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulated industries and compliance-focused AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
