&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a high-caliber&lt;strong&gt; Business Development Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team, focused on managing and expanding our footprint within the &lt;strong&gt;Hyperscale and Cloud Service Provider (CSP)&lt;/strong&gt; market. This is a high-impact customer-facing role that combines technical hardware knowledge with operational excellence to support some of the world&#39;s largest data center customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate understands the unique cadence of the data storage industry—where hardware lifecycles, lead times, and capacity planning are critical to customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
