&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hyperscale Account Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary operational partner for large-scale accounts. You will manage day-to-day requests, track deliverables, and ensure our products meet the rigorous deployment schedules of hyperscale clients. You will be responsible for complex opportunity management, tracking multi-year hardware forecasts, and building reporting that provide visibility into the hyperscale pipeline.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
