&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Management: Coordinate with server ODM and rack integration partners to ensure customer success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Business Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify and pursue new commercial opportunities while nurturing and growing existing client partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Santa Clara office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
