&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Business, Finance, Economics, Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, or a quantitative discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
