&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior, customer-facing technical role within the Customer Success organization. We are looking for a deeply technical leader who can partner with Japanese customers, communicate effectively in Japanese (written and spoken), and guide them toward operational excellence with Portworx.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with customer architects and senior administrators to design, deploy, and optimize mission-critical applications—including databases—within Kubernetes and other container orchestration environments using Portworx.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide advanced technical escalation support to our Technical Support Engineering team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead joint solution development with technology partners to expand the Portworx ecosystem and drive deeper interoperability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted technical advisor to customers and collaborate closely with sales teams to ensure successful adoption, expansion, and long-term satisfaction.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deliver compelling demos, reference architectures, and best practices that highlight the value of Portworx in cloud-native and hybrid environments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create high-quality technical content in Japanese, including deployment guides, implementation documents, operational runbooks, and customer-facing solution material.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
