&lt;p&gt;The Everpure GSI Global Solution Architect (GSA) is a senior-level technical role partnering with end-user sales, pre-sales teams, and cross-functional subject matter experts to drive client success. The GSA combines deep IT industry expertise and business acumen with a background in multiple vertical industries—such as Manufacturing, Healthcare, and Consumer Goods. Success requires both a robust foundation in infrastructure and storage, and a sharp, solution-oriented approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a strategic advisor, the GSA partners closely with Everpure’s global sales teams to engage partners/clients, identify their business and technology needs, and guide their digital transformation. Everpure’s GSI business is a high-growth area, and facilitating meaningful conversations is vital to delivering impactful client outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Everpure’s GSI technical strategy and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the GSI business strategy to grow Everpure revenue and enhance partner outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define end-to-end solutions that align with business growth strategies, leveraging IT and industry-specific best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate the business value and benefits of proposed solutions. Facilitate their adoption by contributing to change programs and proactively identifying misalignments with the evolving solution strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and drive strategic growth opportunities within existing GSI accounts and untapped &#39;white space&#39; Everpure accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boost partner engagement by promoting Everpure’s value propositions and partner program benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross functionally with Everpure’s line-of-business and product teams to improve relevant product features, integrations, and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build credibility as a trusted advisor and cultivate long-term relationships with both existing and prospective stakeholders / clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on industry and technology trends relevant to partner and customer vertical markets, including competitive intelligence, key leaders and market disruptors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with sales teams to develop winning proposals, navigating dynamic and highly competitive market environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a trusted and collaborative conduit between sales, engineering, and product management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key trends and map customer challenges/needs to Everpure’s technology strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspire stakeholders by championing Everpure&#39;s long-term vision and demonstrating how our solutions drive successful transformations and improved business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help preserve and cultivate our technical culture to attract and retain top-tier talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and provide guidance to other employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to marketing activities (roadshows, events and webinars, social media content)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Computer Science or related field or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8-10+ years of experience in technical leadership expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in or with GSI companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product experience across technology vendors and solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication skills (written, verbal, and graphical) with the ability to clearly explain complex concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical foundation with expertise in storage, compute, database, networking, virtualization, and emerging technologies (e.g., AI/ML, Big Data, new stack). Active participation in technical communities and social media is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combine big-picture strategic thinking with detail-oriented problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate an entrepreneurial mindset, drive, and the ability to work both independently and collaboratively. Show genuinely passion to make a meaningful impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate strong executive presence and the ability to evangelize diverse topics, tailoring communication to resonate with any audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively across the broader Everpure Storage organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly accountable and results-driven. Able to adapt focus and pace to thrive in a dynamic, competitive environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
