&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Everpure, we&#39;re building an Emerging Business organization focused on accelerating new growth opportunities from incubation to scalable businesses. As the &lt;strong&gt;Director of Commercial Strategy and Programs&lt;/strong&gt;, you will design and operationalize the commercial systems that enable emerging businesses to scale from early adoption to repeatable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires broad cross-functional fluency and leadership, a deep understanding of how our sales organization operates, and the ability to translate an idea into a repeatable commercial motion—from strategy and pricing, through pipeline creation, to Closed/Won.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build the operational backbone that enables emerging businesses to scale. This includes identifying what needs to change, creating the mechanisms to support it, and bringing together the right teams to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is an incubation role.&lt;/strong&gt; You will operate in ambiguity and solve problems that don&#39;t have established playbooks. When you encounter a wall, you won&#39;t wait for someone else to tell you how to get around it—you&#39;ll find a way around, over, under, or through it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Commercial Models:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and operationalize the pricing and commercial models required to bring emerging products to market—from initial offers and pricing structures to scalable models. This includes Evergreen//One for FlashBlade//EXA, bundles, and other innovative commercial constructs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create Sales Motions &amp;amp; Incentives:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate emerging business strategies into executable sales motions. Design compensation and incentive programs that align the field to the behaviors and bookings needed to build new businesses, and drive adoption of these programs through field enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable New Business Models:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and solve the commercial and operational requirements needed to bring new business models to market, including structuring contracts with third-party hardware and technology providers to enable complete, orderable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make Emerging Products Orderable:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the cross-functional process of turning an emerging product or solution into something the field can actually sell. Navigate pricing approvals, SKUs, contracts, systems, processes, documentation, and other operational requirements to remove barriers to selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Across the Organization:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the connective tissue across Product Management, Finance, Sales, Legal, Marketing, Sales Operations, and other functions. Drive decisions, resolve roadblocks, and keep complex initiatives moving from concept to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
