&lt;li&gt;Strong financial and commercial modeling expertise, including experience evaluating pricing, demand, investment scenarios, and complex business models or commercial structures such as subscription, consumption, licensing, or other recurring-revenue arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success partnering with senior executives across complex organizations, translating financial and operational data into clear insights, recommendations, and tradeoffs that shape decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating complex commercial or contractual arrangements and evaluating their financial implications, with the judgment to balance strategic opportunity, financial risk, and long-term business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building, leading, and developing high-performing Finance teams, including establishing effective operating models, processes, and ways of working in an evolving business environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced financial modeling and analytical capabilities; experience with enterprise planning platforms such as Anaplan and ERP systems such as NetSuite is valuable in supporting a complex planning environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the &lt;strong&gt;Santa Clara, CA office&lt;/strong&gt; in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
