&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, North America Field Alliances will be responsible for driving execution, engagement, evangelism, and activation of Everpure’s most strategic technology alliances across North America. This role sits at the center of Everpure’s field organization, global alliances, channel ecosystem, and partner community to accelerate pipeline creation, co-sell execution, solution adoption, and revenue growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This leader will serve as the primary interface between the North America field organization and the Global Alliances team - translating global alliance strategy into actionable regional execution plans while driving field engagement, seller activation, channel alignment, and measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires a highly visible leader who can energize sales teams, influence executive stakeholders, operationalize co-sell motions, activate channel and GSI ecosystems, and create scalable programs that drive pipeline and bookings impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the North America field execution strategy for Everpure’s top strategic technology alliances.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable business outcomes including pipeline generation, sourced opportunities, bookings influence, co-sell engagement, and net-new logo acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the connective tissue between Global Alliances, North America Sales Leadership, Channel, Marketing, and Systems Engineering teams to ensure aligned execution and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute regional alliance business plans aligned to Everpure’s strategic priorities including AI Factory, Cyber Resilience, Cloud, Modern Virtualization, and Data Platform initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evangelize joint value propositions and “Better Together” narratives internally and externally to energize sellers, channel partners, GSIs, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive field engagement and seller activation through enablement, sales plays, campaigns, executive alignment, North America QBRs, and joint account planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with North America sales leadership and theater teams to embed alliance motions into core sales execution and pipeline development activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Channel and GSI organizations to expand reach, accelerate demand generation, and operationalize scalable partner-led motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and activate strategic channel partners, MSPs and GSIs to amplify joint solutions and accelerate enterprise adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate joint marketing initiatives, demand generation campaigns, workshops, roadshows, and customer engagement activities with alliance partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support co-sell execution including opportunity alignment, marketplace motions, funding programs, partner incentives, PoCs, pilots, and executive escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish operational rigor through business reviews, reporting, KPI tracking, and field feedback mechanisms to continuously improve execution and visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the voice of the North America field back into Global Alliances, Product, Marketing, and Executive Leadership to ensure regional priorities and market dynamics are represented upstream.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
