&lt;p&gt;You will act as a key member of the &lt;strong&gt;UKI Sales Leadership Team&lt;/strong&gt;, partnering with the UKI VP and regional executives to shape Everpure’s overall GTM strategy, optimise channel investment, and represent the Channel business at the executive level both internally and externally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
