&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Cybersecurity Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap: &lt;/strong&gt;Define, document, and execute a comprehensive product security roadmap that enforces robust frameworks, compliance regulations, and security-first principles across all product lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead &amp;amp; Scale Security Engineering: &lt;/strong&gt;Mentor and grow a top-tier team of security engineers, optimizing technical workflows, succession planning, and training budgets to cultivate a collaborative, high-performing culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee Risk Mitigation &amp;amp; Vulnerability Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect end-to-end vulnerability management, code reviews, and threat modeling protocols to discover weaknesses and implement resolution strategies before exploitation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize Security Operations via Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Eliminate manual bottlenecks across the product ecosystem by identifying and implementing automated security tooling, CI/CD integrations, and high-impact third-party partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
