&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an organised, proactive and collaborative Enterprise Field Marketing Specialist.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a junior individual contributor role that supports the execution of enterprise-focused marketing across key EMEA markets and selected key accounts. The EMEA Enterprise Field Marketing Specialist will help drive the planning, coordination and delivery of enterprise-focused marketing programs across EMEA, with a particular focus on core markets (UK, France and Germany) and selected priority accounts. You will help keep trackers up to date, stakeholders informed and deliver activities to a high standard.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the EMEA Enterprise Senior Field Marketing Manager, regional Field Marketing Managers, Sales and wider marketing team, you will help coordinate campaigns, events, reporting and day-to-day project delivery. The successful candidate will be able to work independently (with coaching) to help ensure that enterprise initiatives are well organised, properly followed through and measured consistently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on coordination role that covers multiple marketing disciplines. You will have a chance to work with everyone from marketing operations and data to digital and email campaigns and events and executive experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are detail-oriented, enjoy project management and communication, and want to build your career in enterprise marketing and account-based marketing #teamorange could be a great fit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate enterprise marketing projects, trackers, timelines and follow-up actions across core markets and priority accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support execution of campaigns, events and account-based activities, including campaign set-up, assets, localisation and logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep regional marketing, Sales and supporting teams aligned through meeting coordination, updates and progress tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate records and reporting inputs, helping surface risks, monitor deliverables and support operational compliance including GDPR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Staines-Upon-Thames office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in marketing, project coordination, events, campaign execution or a similar support role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using G Suite, especially Drive, Slides, Docs and Sheets, with confidence managing trackers, lists and reporting inputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisation, communication and follow-through, with the ability to support multiple stakeholders and projects at the same time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in B2B marketing across EMEA, with awareness of localisation, market differences and good data handling practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tools such as Salesforce, Tableau and 6Sense is helpful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SUCCESS IN THIS ROLE LOOKS LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projects are well coordinated and delivered on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trackers, notes and reporting inputs are accurate and easy for the team to use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholders feel informed, supported and clear on next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign and event operations run smoothly with fewer gaps or missed follow-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Enterprise marketing team can move faster because the coordination and delivery basics are consistently well managed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
