&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Instructional Design, Educational Technology, Learning Sciences, Data Science, Business Administration, or a related technical or learning discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in learning architecture, technical partner enablement, systems engineering, technical marketing, knowledge management, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience supporting enterprise technology solutions such as storage, cloud, cybersecurity, AI, or data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of enabling global partner ecosystems across multiple routes to market..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
