&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional ability to translate complex technical information into structured knowledge and learning experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems-thinking mindset with experience designing modular, reusable, AI-ready content architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to facilitate knowledge discovery with senior technical SMEs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of competency-based enablement and persona-driven learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English is required; proficiency in additional languages is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate across functions and geographies in a matrixed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and validating assessments to measure learning effectiveness and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using AI to accelerate learning and knowledge workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), semantic search, metadata, and AI-ready content principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing content that supports both human learning and AI-assisted experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity to continuously explore emerging AI technologies that transform partner enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
