&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;1touch.io is a technology company focused on automated, real-time discovery, mapping, and tracking of sensitive personal data. Its AI-powered platform helps enterprises improve data privacy, security, and governance across complex on-premises and cloud environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Together, 1touch.io and Everpure transform enterprise data from passive storage into an intelligent, context-aware, and governed foundation - making it AI-ready at the source so organizations can securely understand, trust, and activate their data at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Mainframe Software Engineer, you will help design, develop, and modernize core data discovery and scanning capabilities across enterprise systems. You will focus on a Java-based mainframe agent running on IBM z/OS, enabling scalable access to critical mainframe data sources while supporting the modernization of legacy implementations. Working within a broader Java engineering team, you will contribute to cross-platform solutions, share mainframe expertise, and help evolve modern platform capabilities and architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain a Java-based agent running on IBM z/OS systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build capabilities to scan and interact with mainframe technologies, including VSAM, QSAM, IMS, DB2, flat files, and system-level resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and support scalable software solutions from development through production operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain scalable microservices and APIs using Spring and Spring Boot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize performance, scalability, and reliability for large-scale data scanning and processing workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute across the broader Java platform and support engineering initiatives beyond the mainframe domain when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share mainframe expertise and support other engineers in developing knowledge and capabilities within the domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering, architecture, product, and cross-functional teams to solve complex technical challenges and deliver customer-focused outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Prague office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern Java development frameworks such as Spring and Spring Boot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building distributed systems, APIs, or microservices-based architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with containerized environments and orchestration technologies such as Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;IBM z/OS or enterprise mainframe environments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;mainframe technologies and concepts&lt;/strong&gt; such as VSAM, QSAM, JCL, datasets, DB2, IMS, or similar systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and delivering software solutions that balance performance, reliability, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, troubleshooting, and debugging skills, with the ability to solve complex technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, adaptability, and an interest in learning new technologies and evolving engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MAY BE BENEFICIAL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-assisted development tools and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DevOps, CI/CD, and software delivery automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Golang development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;COBOL, REXX, RACF, USS, or other mainframe technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legacy modernization and platform transformation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
