&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;14+ Years of experience in Developer level Linux platform experience; Strong programming skills in C, C++, Python, Java, Go or other programming languages, and solid understanding of object-oriented programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong foundation in data structures, algorithms and a strong understanding of threads, synchronization, concurrent programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills to effectively communicate product architectures, design proposals and negotiate options across stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Preferred Hands-on development experience in Storage Domain and related technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
