&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;Manage the full software development life cycle, from initial architecture and invention through development, release, and ongoing maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Drive the technical strategy by influencing system design, architecture, and best practices, specifically contributing to the evolution of the FlashBlade Networking product area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;Invent and optimize algorithms to orchestrate multi-array and multi-cloud storage systems, focused on achieving industry-leading resiliency and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with world-class engineers across global sites (Silicon Valley, Prague, and Bengaluru) to deliver impactful, customer-focused features.&lt;/p&gt;
