&lt;li&gt;If you enjoy building internal platforms that remove friction, improve visibility, and make engineering teams faster and more effective, this role is for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Is Unique&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is not a typical application development role.You will work on internal platforms that directly shape how engineering teams consume and manage shared infrastructure. The role spans platform engineering, workflow automation, observability, API-driven services, and infrastructure lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The right candidate will work on systems such as:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-serviceability workflows and lease-based testbed governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developer Platform dashboards and APIs used for triage, visibility, and product trend observation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testbed and workflow orchestration across fleet management domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role is a high-leverage engineering investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The work will improve how engineering teams provision testbeds, understand failures, operate shared infrastructure, and move faster with less friction. Better platform workflows and better visibility mean faster triage, stronger governance, cleaner lifecycle management, and a better daily experience for internal engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You Will Build&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Workflows and Services:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will design and enhance platform services that support internal engineering workflows across Internal Developer Platform(IDP) and adjacent fleet systems. This includes APIs, workflow orchestration, service integrations, and operator-facing tooling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI-First approach in designing solutions where consumers can also be AI-agents or agentic workflows and not just humans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testbed Governance: &lt;/strong&gt;You will help evolve the IDP by improving on-demand testbed workflows using AI feedback loops, lease enforcement, policy based governance, lifecycle control, and clean automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dashboarding and Observability: &lt;/strong&gt;You will build and improve live dashboards and data visibility workflows that provide a birds-eye view of test runs, support triage, and help teams understand product and infrastructure trends. Work on clean data such that data insights can be fed to AI based workflows that can make real-time decisions on workload placement and forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Reliability: &lt;/strong&gt;You will debug complex workflow and infrastructure issues, improve correctness and operational behavior, and harden services used by engineering teams every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
