&lt;li&gt;A strong foundation in firmware development for embedded systems, with a deep understanding of hardware and software interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in C/C++ and experience with scripting languages like Python for testing, automation, and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with embedded software or firmware, including microcontrollers and hardware bring-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to debug complex issues and develop effective tools for failure analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Taiwan office in compliance with Pure’s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
