&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Kernel &amp;amp; Driver Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise writing, debugging, and optimizing low-level Linux/Unix device drivers, with deep hands-on command of interrupt handling, memory management, NUMA optimization, and lock contention analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Advanced Storage Protocol Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep technical understanding of SAN architecture and storage protocol stacks, including Fibre Channel (FC-FS, FCP, FC-NVMe) and NVMe over Fabrics (RoCE, TCP, FC), alongside a strong grasp of SAN congestion mechanisms like buffer-to-buffer credits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Systems Systems Tooling &amp;amp; Performance Profiling:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of low-level diagnostics and profiling tools such as &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;110&quot;&gt;perf&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;116&quot;&gt;ftrace&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;124&quot;&gt;eBPF&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;130&quot;&gt;blktrace&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;143&quot;&gt;crash&lt;/code&gt; to identify and resolve complex system transport bottlenecks.&lt;/p&gt;
