&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Polyglot Development Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in C and C++ for core kernel/driver development, paired with Python skills to drive advanced test automation.&lt;/p&gt;
