&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Everpure&#39;s Network &amp;amp; Solutions Engineering team to design, build, and operate the data center networks that power our critical R&amp;amp;D and internal platforms. As a seasoned, experienced professional , you will be a core contributor managing data center and lab networking. You will ensure the reliability of complex network fabrics, border routing, firewalls, and load balancers. By collaborating closely with data center, compute, storage, and platform teams globally , you will resolve a wide range of issues in creative ways&amp;nbsp; to drive seamless engineering operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and resolve data center and lab connectivity, routing, and security incidents to ensure reliable access for engineering testbeds, storage arrays, and compute clusters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate and modernize data center network fabrics, managing spine/leaf switches, border devices, and underlay/overlay connectivity, utilizing your full understanding of your specialization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate identifiable factors to drive projects such as network expansions, hardware migrations, and configuration standardization across sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance network observability and automation by leveraging scripts and playbooks for configuration deployment, reducing manual effort and improving repeatability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide pragmatic guidance and coordinate seamlessly with international engineering teams, data center operations, and vendors to resolve complex problems of diverse scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated hands-on experience in data center or large lab environments , with a strong command of L2/L3 networking, IPv4/IPv6, and routing protocols like BGP and OSPF.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in operating and troubleshooting data center architectures (spine-leaf/Clos), enterprise switching, firewalls, and L4-L7 load balancers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical skills with Linux command-line tools and basic scripting (such as Python or shell) to facilitate troubleshooting and implement light automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong English communication skills to effectively network with internal and external personnel and explain complex network topics to non-network stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Prague, Czechia&amp;nbsp; office in compliance with Everpure’s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
