&lt;p&gt;As the IT Functional Analyst for Order-to-Cash (OTC) Systems, you will serve as the functional lead driving the evolution of Everpure’s global order management and fulfillment landscape on SAP S/4HANA. Operating at an individual contributor level, you will act as a critical connector between Global Supply Chain operations, Sales, and technical engineering squads. Your mission will be to architect and implement highly scalable, complex order management systems—including advanced configuration workflows—ensuring our Order-to-Cash infrastructure seamlessly handles high-volume global transactions with peak operational velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
