&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect Advanced Product Workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Spearhead the system design for complex order scenarios, including Configure-to-Order (CTO) models, Variant Configuration (VC/AVC), and serialization/installed-base management workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate Cross-Functional Initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary team lead coordinating activities across disparate functional areas—including Finance (AR), Materials Management (MM), Global Trade Services (GTS), and Customer Service—to deliver seamless ecosystem integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize and Innovate Processes:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze highly variable business factors and data to identify system bottlenecks, independently introducing automation and optimization to improve order accuracy, reduce cycle times, and minimize custom code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resolve High-Impact Issues:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the advanced escalation point for complex technical system issues, performing root-cause analysis and translating intricate business requirements into precise functional specifications and configuration guides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
