&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Configuration Scenario Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong domain knowledge of complex scenario modeling, such as Configure-to-Order (CTO), Advanced Variant Configuration, and modern SAP Fiori applications.&lt;/li&gt;
