&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is in the middle of an S/4HANA transformation, and Order Management (OM) sits at the center of it — every customer order, price, and contract has to work the same way after go-live as it does today. This role owns the OM process expertise that makes that possible: translating how order-to-cash actually runs today into how it needs to run in SAP, and catching the gaps before they become production problems. You&#39;ll work shoulder-to-shoulder with functional and technical implementation teams, testing and validating the system against the realities of the business rather than just the spec.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own OM process design and validation across the SAP implementation lifecycle, from initial build through post-go-live stabilization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead UAT, integration testing, and data validation for order processing and financial posting, catching discrepancies before they reach customers or the books&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide data migration decisions for customer, pricing, and contract master data, ensuring nothing critical is lost or misconfigured in the move&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose process and system issues at the root cause and drive the fix, not just the workaround&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare the business for go-live through training and change management so teams can operate confidently in the new system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep fluency in order-to-cash processes and how they interact with pricing, contracts, and downstream financial posting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience carrying at least one full-cycle SAP implementation from design through deployment, ideally on S/4HANA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of SAP SD and how it integrates with MM, FI, and CRM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and root-cause problem-solving skills, with the judgment to know when a system issue needs a process fix versus a technical one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
