&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every deal that closes in a channel-driven business still has to become an accurate, bookable order and that&#39;s where this role lives. You&#39;ll sit at the intersection of Sales, Finance, Operations, and our channel partners, making sure purchase orders match what was actually sold before they hit the books. Beyond day-to-day order review, you&#39;ll help modernize how Order Management works: spotting process gaps, contributing to automation, and building the tools and documentation that let the team scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own order accuracy from opportunity to booking, validating purchase orders against Salesforce quotes and opportunities for pricing, configuration, currency, and reference-field alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep deals moving by partnering with Sales, Sales Ops, Finance, Operations, and Channel Partners to resolve discrepancies and communicate order status in real time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate internal teams and partners on order policies and booking requirements, catching issues at the PO review stage before they cause delays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive process improvement across Order Management: identifying manual bottlenecks, updating documentation and reporting, and contributing to automation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evaluate and adopt new tools and system capabilities that raise order quality and improve the partner and customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an &lt;strong&gt;in-office environment&lt;/strong&gt; and therefore, you will be expected to work from the &lt;strong&gt;Lehi, UT&lt;/strong&gt; office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on fluency with Salesforce and ERP systems (e.g., NetSuite), with the judgment to catch discrepancies between a purchase order, quote, and opportunity before they become booking delays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working within a channel-driven sales model, including experience handling customer or partner purchase orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp attention to detail and a track record of maintaining accuracy under shifting deadlines and non-routine requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional communication skills, with the ability to drive issue resolution professionally across Sales, Finance, and Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated eye for process improvement. You&#39;ve helped standardize a workflow, streamline reporting, or push an automation or modernization effort forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
