&lt;p&gt;Working closely with a Partner Technical Manager (PTM), you will be a critical driver in positioning Everpure as the most innovative and trusted business partner to our channels. You will collaborate cross-functionally with Sales, Technical, Channel, Support, and Marketing teams to achieve success.&lt;/p&gt;
