&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Pure Storage is looking for a Partner Account Manager (PAM) to develop and manage the Reseller and Distributor relationships based in Hong Kong.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;&quot;&gt;The successful PAM will work in tandem with Regional Sales Directors, District Managers and Account Executives to successfully develop and service all partners and prospects.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Partner Account Manager (PAM) is responsible for driving revenue growth and market share&amp;nbsp;through a defined portfolio of named Focus Partners, owning the end-to-end relationship, joint business&amp;nbsp;planning, and execution of Everpure’s go-to-market strategy with those partners. Each PAM is measured&amp;nbsp;and compensated on the growth trajectory of their assigned Focus Partner portfolio, not on ad-hoc&amp;nbsp;or unmanaged partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner portfolio ownership &amp;amp; strategy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a defined portfolio of named Focus Partners in the assigned territory and act as the single&amp;nbsp;accountable owner for their performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute joint business plans with each partner, covering bookings, partner-sourced pipeline, marketing activities, enablement and capacity building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Segment and prioritize partners based on growth potential and Everpure strategic focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Revenue, pipeline &amp;amp; GTM execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver indirect revenue and bookings targets through partners and drive partner-sourced&amp;nbsp;pipeline via programs, campaigns, and sales plays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate execution of Everpure sales motions and solutions with partners, leveraging channel&amp;nbsp;programs, incentives, and MDF (where applicable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accurate pipeline hygiene and forecasting for the partner portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner relationship management &amp;amp; enablement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong executive and sales relationships within each partner, positioning&amp;nbsp;Everpure as a strategic vendor of choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive partner onboarding, competency and certification, coordinating with Inside PAM (iPAM),&amp;nbsp;SEs and other specialists as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure partners understand and correctly use Everpure tools and processes (e.g., Partner&amp;nbsp;Central access, user registration flows routed to country PAMs where applicable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with AEs, SEs, Distribution Account Managers (DAMs), PTMs and&amp;nbsp;DLM/GPO leadership to ensure aligned account and partner strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the partner’s advocate internally, coordinating resolution of issues that impact partner satisfaction or sales velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Governance, compliance &amp;amp; reporting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate partner records, account plans, and activity notes in the designated systems&amp;nbsp;and rubrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and lead regular QBRs and performance reviews with key partners, measuring&amp;nbsp;progress against joint plans and agreed KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to Everpure policies, pricing guidelines, and channel rules of engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual bookings and revenue growth from assigned Focus Partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner-sourced pipeline volume and conversion rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coverage and engagement: execution against agreed business plans, cadence of QBRs and&amp;nbsp;sales/enablement activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner health and satisfaction scores (where measured).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accuracy and timeliness of forecasts, rubrics and CRM hygiene for the partner portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in channel/partner sales or PAM/PSM role in the IT/enterprise infrastructure&amp;nbsp;or SaaS industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of exceeding revenue and pipeline targets through partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build C-level and sales-level relationships within partners and drive&amp;nbsp;joint execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of distribution and channel programs, including how to leverage&amp;nbsp;incentives and marketing funds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent sales, negotiation, and account planning skills; strong analytical skills to interpret&amp;nbsp;data and partner metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in business, IT or related field; MBA a plus (optional, adjust to local standard).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join EverPure Hong Kong team and be part of a team that&#39;s redefining data storage. Apply now and unleash your potential!&lt;/p&gt;
