&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architect Comprehensive Qualification &amp;amp; Automation Frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;: Oversee functional specifications and automated stress testing environments—leveraging Linux, Python, PCIe, DDR, Ethernet, and serial bus protocols—to guarantee sub-system reliability and accelerate time-to-market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Champion Cross-Functional Hardware Operations &amp;amp; System Hardening&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with Manufacturing, Operations, and Escalation teams to streamline production handoffs for new storage sub-systems and perform deep root-cause failure analysis that permanently hardens enterprise products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Establish Quality-by-Design Standards &amp;amp; Best Practices&lt;/strong&gt;: Define hardware validation methodologies, collaborate across organizational boundaries, and build engineering networks that continuously elevate quality benchmarks across all product development lifecycles.&lt;/p&gt;
