&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain technical documentation, FAQs, and knowledge base articles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share insights with sales, success and product teams to improve processes and product usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel up to 10-25% based on customer requirements and business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
