&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every return is a moment where we either rebuild a customer&#39;s trust or lose it — and this role owns that moment end to end. As our Returns Specialist, you&#39;ll run the Pick-Up Request process that turns a customer return into a tracked, resolved, accurately recorded transaction across SAP, NetSuite, and Salesforce. You&#39;ll sit at the intersection of Sales, Logistics, and our contract manufacturer&#39;s operations in Newark, working daily with carriers and vendors to keep returns moving and the data behind them clean.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own the Pick-Up Request process end to end, keeping customer return requests moving accurately and on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Keep return data in sync across SAP, NetSuite, and Salesforce so operations, reporting, and inventory all tell the same story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Resolve return issues — incorrect shipments, missing parts, customer questions — acting as the point person between logistics partners, carriers, and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Turn return trend and root-cause data into concrete process improvements that cut cycle time and reduce errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Maintain inventory accuracy across systems of record while keeping return handling compliant with company policy and shipping regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;We are primarily an i&lt;strong&gt;n-office environmen&lt;/strong&gt;t and therefore, you will be expected to work from the &lt;strong&gt;Santa Clara, HQ&lt;/strong&gt; office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience in reverse logistics, order administration, or sales operations, with working fluency in ERP and CRM platforms such as SAP, NetSuite, or Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;The organizational range to manage multiple return workflows at once in a fast-paced environment, adjusting priorities as things shift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Sharp attention to detail and strong problem-solving instincts, with good judgment about when to resolve an issue directly versus escalate it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Clear, professional communication for coordinating across internal teams, carriers, and external vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
