&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;End-to-End Reverse Supply Chain Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with internal teams (Logistics, IT, Quality, Customer Support) and external 3PL and repair partners to design and refine returns routing, RMA workflows, and inventory disposition, directly reducing processing turnaround times and elevating customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Performance &amp;amp; KPI Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Own key operational metrics across reverse operations—including turnaround time, cost per return, and recovery yield—utilizing data-driven analysis and continuous improvement frameworks to maximize asset recovery and network profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Systems Integration &amp;amp; Change Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead cross-functional implementations and enhancements for returns portals, warehouse management systems (WMS), and repair tracking tools to ensure end-to-end tracking, inventory accuracy, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Sustainability &amp;amp; Regulatory Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive circular economy initiatives by maximizing product reuse and waste reduction while ensuring all reverse logistics operations strictly comply with global trade, environmental, and safety regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
