&lt;li&gt;Identify, qualify and set appointments for field counterparts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding and research on key target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Field Marketing to develop outbound call campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help progress opportunities as needed and directed with field AE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle project upsells and renewals as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
