&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and detail-oriented&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sales Planning Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Global Sales Operations team. This role is central to our &lt;strong&gt;account data cleanup initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, and will play a critical part in maintaining account data integrity, supporting sales planning operations, driving process governance, and enabling accurate downstream reporting and sales execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has &lt;strong&gt;deep, hands-on experience managing and remediating account data at scale&lt;/strong&gt; — including hierarchy corrections, segmentation cleanup, and disposition standardization — combined with strong business acumen, analytical rigor, and problem-solving capabilities. This individual should be comfortable working cross-functionally across Sales Planning, MDM, and Engineering teams to drive operational excellence, scalable processes, and high-quality master data management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
