&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end &lt;strong&gt;account data cleanup projects&lt;/strong&gt;, including identifying, prioritizing, and resolving data quality issues across account hierarchy, segmentation, revenue, industry, and disposition fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive &lt;strong&gt;large-scale remediation efforts&lt;/strong&gt; for incorrect parent-child hierarchies, segment misclassifications, inactive accounts, and missing or invalid dispositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, monitor, and document overrides to key account attributes to ensure alignment with Sales Planning policies, business rules, and reporting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain audit-ready documentation and traceability for manual overrides, hierarchy modifications, and disposition changes to support internal controls, governance standards, and financial reporting compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and manage Reltio workflow notifications by monitoring data issues, routing system alerts to appropriate stakeholders, and driving timely resolution and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Data Governance &amp;amp; Integrity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and maintain the accuracy of account data across systems including Salesforce (SFDC), Reltio, D&amp;amp;B, and Anaplan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and manage account hierarchy, segment, revenue, industry, and other key account attributes to ensure alignment with Sales Planning rules and reporting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the &lt;strong&gt;go-to expert on account data structure and integrity&lt;/strong&gt;, setting standards for how data quality issues are identified and resolved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Audits &amp;amp; Process Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute periodic audits to validate account hierarchies, segmentation, assignments, and key planning attributes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with MDM and IT teams to identify root causes and implement scalable process improvements that &lt;strong&gt;prevent data quality issues upstream&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend and drive operational enhancements that improve data quality, governance, and planning efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Planning Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the annual and ongoing sales planning cycles by validating account assignments and planning-related data across SFDC, Reltio, and Anaplan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key fields and dependencies that impact quota assignment, territory alignment, forecasting, and sales crediting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide analytical support and insights to improve planning accuracy and operational effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Sales Planning, MDM, Engineering, and Sales Operations stakeholders to resolve account-related issues and improve business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted partner and subject matter expert on account hierarchy management, data governance, and planning operations best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively communicate findings, risks, and recommendations to stakeholders across global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years of experience in Sales Operations, Business Operations, or Master Data Management, with a strong track record of hands-on account data cleanup, hierarchy remediation, and governance work&lt;/strong&gt; (required — this is a core function of the role, not a peripheral responsibility).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience &lt;strong&gt;leading or executing large-scale data cleanup or remediation projects&lt;/strong&gt; involving account hierarchies, segmentation, or master data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with Salesforce (SFDC) and Anaplan; &lt;strong&gt;hands-on experience with Reltio and D&amp;amp;B strongly preferred&lt;/strong&gt; (not just familiarity).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Excel and Google Sheets for analysis and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of sales planning processes, territory management, quota allocation, and sales compensation dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to collaborate across global teams and influence without authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work cross-functionally and influence stakeholders in a matrixed global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills with the ability to simplify complex operational issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, highly organized, and adaptable with a continuous improvement mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting global sales organizations is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
