&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;As a SAP Financials Functional Analyst, you will serve as the strategic architect of our financial reporting and asset management ecosystem. You will bridge the gap between complex accounting requirements and cutting-edge technology, transforming how our global finance teams track capital investments and visualize performance data. Collaborating closely with Finance leadership and IT engineering, you will deliver a seamless, automated SAP S/4HANA environment that drives real-time business intelligence and fiscal accuracy. Your mission is to turn complex financial data into a world-class engine for growth and transparency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architect the Asset Lifecycle:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the end-to-end design and configuration of SAP Asset Accounting (FI-AA), creating seamless integrations with General Ledger and Project Systems to automate capital project capitalization and ensure depreciation precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Execute Full-Lifecycle Implementations:&lt;/strong&gt; Orchestrate critical functional workstreams through every phase of SAP deployment—from initial discovery and functional specifications to high-stakes UAT and post-go-live stabilization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Optimize Global Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and champion automation opportunities within the FI-CO landscape to eliminate manual reconciliation, enhance global scalability, and ensure rigorous compliance with international financial standards.&lt;/p&gt;
