&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Alignment &amp;amp; Release Readiness:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead cross-functional defect triage sessions, manage quality metrics dashboards, and coordinate business-facing User Acceptance Testing (UAT) to align final software deliverables with business expectations and guarantee smooth go-live cutovers.&lt;/li&gt;
