&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SAP S/4HANA &amp;amp; Functional Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong functional testing capability across core SAP modules (STP, RTR, ITR) along with the proficiency to analyze complex business requirements and engineer comprehensive end-to-end test plans.&lt;/li&gt;
