&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an SAP SAC Consultant at Everpure, you will spearhead the modernization of enterprise analytics, planning, and reporting capabilities within our global Finance Systems ecosystem. Partnering closely with FP&amp;amp;A, Accounting, Data Engineering, and IT teams, you will architect and optimize scalable corporate financial models utilizing SAP Analytics Cloud (SAC) and SAP Datasphere. By delivering actionable executive dashboards, predictive forecasting frameworks, and unified data streams, you will directly empower leadership with trusted insights to accelerate business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Planning Model Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the design, build, and continuous optimization of SAP Analytics Cloud (SAC) Planning models for corporate budgeting, rolling forecasts, and complex what-if scenario planning to maximize global financial predictability. Design and optimize semantic models, dimensions, hierarchies, calculations, and KPIs to ensure consistent and trusted enterprise reporting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Analytics &amp;amp; Dashboards:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and scale high-impact executive dashboards, KPI scorecards, and automated financial reports. Design and optimize semantic models, dimensions, hierarchies, calculations, and KPIs to ensure consistent and trusted enterprise reporting. transforming raw data into intuitive self-service intelligence. Develop reporting solutions supporting General Ledger (GL), Accounts Payable (AP), Accounts Receivable (AR), Fixed Assets (AA), Cost Centers, Profit Centers, revenue reporting, operating expenses, and P&amp;amp;L analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Lifecycle &amp;amp; Ecosystem Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Data Engineering units to drive the seamless integration of SAP S/4HANA Finance data and external systems via SAP Datasphere, establishing a unified, governed semantic layer that ensures global data consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validation &amp;amp; Testing Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead functional specifications engineering, continuous process documentation, and cross-functional testing cycles (SIT/UAT) for enterprise analytics enhancements to guarantee high-quality, zero-defect production deployments. Train and support Finance users to maximize adoption of SAP analytics, planning, and reporting capabilities. Troubleshoot reporting, planning, and data integration issues, performing root cause analysis and implementing sustainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional SAP Analytics Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 4+ years of hands-on experience implementing and supporting SAP analytics, planning, and reporting solutions, with deep technical and functional exposure to SAP Analytics Cloud (SAC) and SAP Datasphere architectures. Proven Techno functional experience implementing or supporting SAP Business Data Cloud (BDC), SAP Analytics Cloud (SAC), and SAP Datasphere.&lt;/li&gt;
