&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SAP IBP Technical Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven practical proficiency working daily inside SAP IBP Demand Planning (or SAP APO DP) environments, with strong technical comfort navigating IBP Excel Add-ins and Fiori-based planning views.&lt;/li&gt;
