&lt;p&gt;This role owns the full lifecycle of graph intelligence solutions &lt;strong&gt;—&lt;/strong&gt; from problem definition and data modelling, to building and enriching knowledge graphs, and deploying ML- and LLM-assisted analytics in production. The focus is on semantic and contextual analysis of unstructured data to uncover relationships, patterns, and insights that support AI safety, security, and compliance requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
