&lt;p data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;You will serve as a key operational partner responsible for improving business processes, defining requirements for system enhancements, leveraging analytics to drive decision-making, and helping scale subscription growth through operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
