&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dotmyr&quot; data-start=&quot;1704&quot; data-end=&quot;1872&quot;&gt;Translate business needs into clear functional requirements by defining, documenting, and validating system enhancements in partnership with IT and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
