&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kqy42n&quot; data-start=&quot;2259&quot; data-end=&quot;2423&quot;&gt;Drive adoption of new operational processes, product capabilities, and system enhancements through cross-functional collaboration and effective change management.&lt;/li&gt;
