&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architect the Global Community Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute the end-to-end digital and in-person community roadmap (including community.purestorage.com), aligning user-focused networks directly with core corporate growth objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
