&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co-Create Governance in Emergent Spaces:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and define clear architectural guidelines, checklists, and workflows where mature standards do not yet exist, helping teams move quickly without compromising security or data privacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate Platform Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide business teams on how to maximize shared enterprise AI platforms and fully exploit native AI features embedded within our SaaS, QTC, and ERP systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Streamline Compliance and Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Operationalize risk-based governance and deployment patterns for copilots and agents, helping business units clear compliance hurdles quickly and predictably scale proven AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
