&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is seeking a strategic, design-oriented, and execution-focused workplace leader to oversee Workplace Strategy, Design, and Delivery across the Americas region. This role is responsible for defining and evolving the workplace vision, translating business needs into scalable workplace solutions, and ensuring successful delivery of all workplace capital projects across a growing and dynamic portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This leader will own end-to-end workplace planning, design governance, capital prioritization, and delivery oversight for offices, campuses, lab environments, and technical spaces. The role requires a strong balance of strategic thinking, design leadership, and hands-on capital program oversight in partnership with external project managers, architects, engineers, and construction partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings experience operating in high-growth, fast-paced environments where workplace strategy, design excellence, and capital delivery must be tightly integrated to support business scale and employee experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Strategy &amp;amp; Portfolio Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead workplace strategy across the Americas portfolio, aligning workplace investments with business growth, organizational design, and employee experience goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop long-range portfolio strategies, occupancy models, headcount forecasting frameworks, and space utilization analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive campus planning and master planning initiatives, including future capacity planning and multi-site expansion strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with executive leadership, HR, Finance, IT, and business stakeholders to translate organizational needs into workplace strategies and space requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish scalable workplace planning principles, portfolio standards, and governance frameworks across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategic initiatives including restacks, consolidations, hybrid workplace models, and workplace transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Design Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own workplace programming, concept development, and design direction across all Americas projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain workplace design standards, guidelines, and principles across office, lab, and technical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistency of employee experience, brand alignment, functionality, sustainability, and operational efficiency across all workplace environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with architects, interior designers, engineers, and furniture vendors to guide design development and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design reviews and provide decision-making leadership throughout project lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation in workplace design, including future-of-work concepts and new workplace typologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capital Delivery Oversight &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own capital planning, prioritization, and governance across all workplace-related projects in the Americas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee delivery of office buildouts, expansions, renovations, lab environments, and new site launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external project management firms, architects, contractors, and consultants to ensure successful execution of all capital programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish project governance frameworks including scope control, budget management, schedule oversight, and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead portfolio-level reporting on capital projects, including executive updates, dashboards, and performance tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment between Workplace Strategy, Workplace Operations, and Capital Delivery execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support FF&amp;amp;E planning, procurement coordination, occupancy planning, and move management in partnership with delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure successful project closeout and transition into Workplace Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics, Reporting &amp;amp; Decision Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop workplace analytics frameworks to support data-driven decision-making across portfolio planning and capital investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage occupancy, utilization, and space data to optimize workplace efficiency and inform strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive-level reporting tools, dashboards, and insights to support capital allocation and portfolio strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate data into clear recommendations for leadership decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to senior leadership on workplace strategy, capital investments, and portfolio evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Workplace Operations, IT, Security, HR, Finance, Procurement, Legal, and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment between workplace strategy, capital delivery, and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive consistency in how workplace projects are initiated, designed, and delivered across the Americas region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help mature the Americas REWSS function by introducing scalable frameworks, governance, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Santa Clara, CA&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
