&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Operations Engineering (APAC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Hsinchu, Taiwan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverPure is seeking a highly experienced and strategic &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Operations Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; to lead regional engineering execution across APAC. This role serves as a critical bridge between product development, suppliers, and manufacturing partners, ensuring successful new product introduction (NPI), supplier quality performance, and manufacturing excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will lead distributed engineering teams across the United States, Malaysia, and Vietnam, while acting as the primary Operations Engineering interface with Hsinchu-based teams during NPI phases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role will have to be based in our partner location in Hsinchu, Taiwan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Regional Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and scale a geographically distributed team of Supplier Quality Engineers (SQE), Manufacturing Quality Engineers (MQE), and Component Engineers across the United States, Malaysia, and Vietnam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a high-performance culture focused on accountability, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build organizational capability to support evolving business and operational needs across APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. NPI &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary Operations Engineering interface in Hsinchu, Taiwan for all NPI programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with internal and external stakeholders, including R&amp;amp;D, Product Engineering, and Program Management, to ensure seamless product introduction and ramp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Design for Manufacturing (DFM) and Design for Test (DFT) initiatives, ensuring early risk identification and mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Supplier Quality &amp;amp; Component Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end supplier quality management, including supplier qualification, performance monitoring, and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and enforce robust component engineering practices, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Component selection and validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk mitigation strategies (e.g., second sourcing, obsolescence planning)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead supplier audits, corrective and preventive actions (CAPA), and yield improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Manufacturing Quality &amp;amp; Operations Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee manufacturing quality performance across APAC DFM sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive key quality and operational metrics, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Yield improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Failure analysis and root cause resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process capability and control (e.g., Cp, Cpk)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement scalable quality systems, processes, and performance metrics (e.g., FPY, DPPM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary liaison between:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hsinchu-based Engineering and NPI teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract manufacturers and suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Operations and Business leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear and concise communication on program status, risks, mitigation plans, and readiness to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6. Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the APAC Operations Engineering strategy in alignment with global organizational objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion Lean, Six Sigma, and data-driven methodologies to drive operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement opportunities to optimize cost, quality, and cycle time across the supply chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
