&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10–15+ years of experience in Operations Engineering, Manufacturing Engineering, or Supplier Quality within the &lt;strong&gt;electronics, hardware, or data center industry&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing &lt;strong&gt;regional or global engineering teams&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
