&lt;li&gt;Experience working with contract manufacturing models, including EMS, JDM, and ODM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
