&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every customer payment has to land in the right place, on the right account, without slowing down the close. As our Senior Cash App Analyst, you&#39;ll be the subject matter expert who makes that happen — researching remittances, resolving exceptions, and reconciling activity across multiple entities, currencies, and payment channels. You&#39;ll work closely with Accounts Receivable, Collections, Treasury, Accounting, Revenue, Tax, Customer Success, and Sales, and your accuracy directly shapes how clean the books are at month-end and how confident the team is in the numbers come audit time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own daily payment application across lockbox, ACH, wire, and check channels, catching late postings and reporting gaps before they become AR discrepancies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve unapplied and exception payments — chasing down missing remittance, FX variances, and account discrepancies until every dollar is matched to the right invoice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive marketplace reconciliation and maintain the documentation trail that lets Audit, Treasury, and Accounting trust the numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support month-end and quarter-end close and SOX controls, helping the team hit accelerated close timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot and act on opportunities to improve payment matching, automation, and exception handling, rather than just processing what comes in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep working knowledge of cash application, bank reconciliation, and remittance management, with the judgment to resolve exceptions and unapplied cash without escalating every edge case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating inside enterprise ERP systems (SAP ECC/S4HANA, Oracle, or similar) and automated cash application platforms like HighRadius&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency across multiple payment channels — ACH, wire, lockbox, check, credit card, and electronic payment platforms — and the reconciliation nuances each one brings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel skills (PivotTables, XLOOKUP/VLOOKUP, complex formulas) used to investigate discrepancies and build reporting, not just format spreadsheets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Lehi, UT office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
