&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Middleware Unification &amp;amp; Scaling:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect, build, and optimize high-throughput Java and Spring-based middleware services, developing the unification layer that bridges FlashArray and FlashBlade product lines for seamless enterprise management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support End-to-End Features:&lt;/strong&gt; Support complex features across the full software development lifecycle—from initial API design and CLI/GUI integration to debugging, refactoring, and release deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate Engineering Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a domain consultant and mentor for engineering teams across the Java ecosystem, establishing code quality standards, hosting office hours, and upskilling peers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modernize Core Codebases:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously improve codebase health and scalability by refactoring legacy architectures, optimizing performance under high load, and leveraging AI tools to automate routine development tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Java:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep technical expertise in core Java and the Spring ecosystem (Spring Boot, Hibernate, jOOQ), with a proven track record of designing, building, and troubleshooting complex backend applications rather than maintaining legacy systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise-Scale Project Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven capability to lead and deliver mid-to-large backend engineering projects in complex enterprise environments, navigating architecture trade-offs with clear technical ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Middleware &amp;amp; API Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated capability in developing RESTful APIs, CLI tools, and middleware services, backed by strong fundamentals in data structures, concurrency, and system design.&lt;/li&gt;
