&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize Core CI/CD Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Extend and tune complex, distributed multi-machine build and test frameworks (such as Jenkins or equivalent) to eliminate environment bottlenecks and accelerate development cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance Observability and Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; Standardize monitoring, logging, and incident management practices by building custom tools that surface metrics, logs, and traces to accelerate troubleshooting and root-cause resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
