&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Mastery &amp;amp; Containerization:&lt;/strong&gt; Robust Linux/Unix fundamentals combined with hands-on experience implementing containerization and orchestration infrastructure (such as Kubernetes, Docker Swarm, or Nomad) to debug complex distributed environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Engineering &amp;amp; Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience managing large-scale CI/CD platforms coupled with a background in integrating proactive monitoring, logging, and alerting systems into engineering pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
