&lt;li&gt;You will be working with a global team of software engineers who develop new features and capabilities with a rapid rate of change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for driving multiple parallel product releases in a fast pace environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Bangalore office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
