&lt;li&gt;Outstanding verbal and written communication skills with the ability to interact with technical and non-technical, cross-functional groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced understanding and extensive use of Jira Cloud in software development program management and release management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated strong analytical and problem solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Big picture thinker providing clarity on what we are trying to accomplish, understanding of the business objectives and driving the outcome for the program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capabilities to identify and recommend process changes that would enable faster time to market while driving organization consistency and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of end-to-end SDLC best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing projects throughout the entire SDLC, including investigation, design, planning, execution and delivering products to market on schedule, and addressing customer feedback in development. Solid knowledge of end-to-end SDLC best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive content, schedule and overall delivery of the program and set it up for success in the field and customer base for overall Go-To-Market readiness and New Product Introduction&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognize when trade-offs and timely decisions are needed; drive the necessary discussions to conclusion and drive accountability for delivery and ensure that the objectives of the program are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your solid project and technical skills and judgment to build credibility with technical leaders and demonstrate the ability to influence multiple functions across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team and customer focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of the product experience, product quality and associated health metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set goals for the program, track and periodically communicate to stakeholders as well as executive leadership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure corrective actions and risk mitigations are in place as needed to keep programs and releases on track&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the single point person for delivery decisions, exec and cross team communication and working with various functional groups to deliver the program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize team processes to improve quality, productivity, and responsiveness to feedback and changing priorities along with setting up the program for success in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative; overcome obstacles by resolving issues, regardless of team boundaries, and identify and resolve teamwork issues.&lt;/li&gt;
