&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Service Account Manager, you won&#39;t just keep systems running — you&#39;ll be the strategic bridge between world-class storage infrastructure and the business outcomes our customers care about most. You&#39;ll act as a trusted advisor to some of Japan&#39;s most &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;strategic &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;enterprise environments, orchestrating global resources to resolve critical incidents, drive proactive system health, and turn operational reliability into long-term customer loyalty and growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
