&lt;li&gt;Experience monitoring and resolving incidents and&amp;nbsp; providing real-time user support in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;analyze data&lt;/strong&gt;, identify trends, and recommend improvements to workflows, platforms, and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset, comfortable working across teams and departments to support business goals.&lt;strong&gt;Highly organized&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to juggle multiple tasks and priorities while maintaining high-quality service.Basic ability to read &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript&lt;/strong&gt; required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow &lt;/strong&gt;certifications beyond a CSA are a plus, especially in modules such as CMDB, CSM, HRSD, WSD, LSD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ServiceNow integrations such as SAP, Workday, NICE InContact, etc. is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with testing integrations with tools like Postman is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with scrum agile and Program Increment (PI) planning frameworks are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with how to write RCA (5 Why’s) is a plus&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
