&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As a Solution Architect, SKU Transformation &amp;amp; Master Data Management, you will architect the foundational enterprise data models that power fast, seamless product launches across Everpure™. In this role, you will bridge the gap between product innovation and operational execution, serving as the strategic architect for our Master Data Management (MDM) ecosystem. Collaborating closely with Product Management, Engineering, and Business Operations, you will design scalable frameworks that ensure total data integrity, streamline New Product Introductions (NPI), and drive business agility worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Architect End-to-End Enterprise Data Models: Design and implement scalable Product Master and MDM architectures connecting ERP, CRM, PLM, and billing systems to enable seamless data flow and support dynamic, bundled product offerings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead SKU Transformation &amp;amp; Governance: Establish global data governance frameworks, validation rules, and stewardship workflows to rationalize legacy catalog items, mitigate operational risks (e.g., duplicates, inconsistent hierarchies), and maintain high-fidelity data integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Accelerate New Product Introductions (NPI): Partner cross-functionally with Engineering, Operations, and Product teams to build automated, repeatable onboarding workflows that bring new offerings from PLM to market faster and with zero system friction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive Measurable Business Impact: Establish trackable NPI readiness milestones, lifecycle versioning, and integration patterns to significantly reduce time-to-market and ensure flawless operational launch execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Solution Architecture Expertise: Comprehensive experience designing enterprise-grade solution architectures centered on Master Data Management (MDM), SKU transformation, and NPI enablement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deep Technical Mastery in MDM &amp;amp; Data Modeling: Demonstrated success building robust product master data models (attributes, hierarchies, relationships) and configuring data stewardship, security, validation, and integration patterns across ERP, CRM, and billing platforms (e.g., Informatica MDM, Reltio, SAP MDG, Oracle PDH, or similar).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership: Proven capability to guide complex cross-system integration programs, align cross-functional stakeholders around governance standards, and connect technical design to strategic business outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
