&lt;li&gt;Deploy and operate AI services on AWS, leveraging services such as EC2, S3, Lambda, RDS, and containerization using Docker and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strong security best practices, including access control, data protection, audit logging, and secure API design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strong observability, monitoring, and reliability of AI-driven services in production.&lt;/li&gt;
