&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineering Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in building and scaling production-grade services (ideally in Go or Python) within AWS or similar major cloud environments, with a focus on API design and system reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; A deep understanding of modern security fundamentals, including PKI/certificates, TLS/mTLS, OAuth/OIDC, and IAM concepts, with the ability to apply &quot;defense in depth&quot; to distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with the modern SDLC, including CI/CD pipelines, Terraform (or equivalent IaC), and comprehensive observability (metrics, logging, and alerting) for mission-critical services.&lt;/li&gt;
