&lt;p&gt;As the Expert Solution Architect for Supply Chain Management, you will serve as the principal visionary shaping Everpure’s global operational blueprint on the S/4HANA platform. Operating as a premier individual contributor, you will navigate highly complex, unique ecosystem variables to align multi-faceted business strategies with cutting-edge technical architecture. By building collaborative formal networks across Logistics, Manufacturing, Procurement, and broader IT squads, you will establish the technical governance and &quot;clean core&quot; strategies needed to scale Everpure’s global infrastructure for next-generation technology demands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
