&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Platform Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish the long-term technical direction and evaluation criteria for corporate supply chain platforms, visualizing intricate platform dependencies and defining robust governance models for critical master data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Seamless Ecosystem Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the architectural design of resilient interfaces connecting core ERP modules, third-party logistics (3PL) networks, and manufacturing execution systems (MES).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Govern Delivery Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Define cross-functional testing methodologies and execution criteria, overseeing advanced configuration validation, system integration testing (SIT), and user acceptance testing (UAT) across global deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate Executive Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Convene and lead high-impact design workshops, utilizing exceptional negotiation capabilities to align executive leadership, business stakeholders, and technical delivery partners on major functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Santa Clara, CA office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
