&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expert S/4HANA Domain Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive architectural knowledge across major S/4HANA logistics domains, including Planning &amp;amp; Forecasting (IBP, aATP, MRP Live), Sourcing &amp;amp; Procurement (P2P), and Logistics &amp;amp; Fulfillment (TM, OTC) integrated with Configure-to-Order (CTO) processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Manufacturing Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in Production Planning (PP), Variant Configuration for complex product structures, and contract manufacturing workflows in a global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Architecture Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience steering full-lifecycle SAP S/4HANA implementations using the SAP Activate Methodology, Agile frameworks, and Enterprise Architecture visualization tools (such as LeanIX or Ardoq).&lt;/li&gt;
