&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SHOULD YOU ACCEPT THIS CHALLENGE...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a strategic, analytically rigorous individual to fill the role of a &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Insights Manager &lt;/strong&gt;within the Commercial Strategy &amp;amp; Transformation team. This role will serve as a critical partner in driving a 360° view of business performance, supporting the Line of Business (LoB) Rhythm of the Business (RtB), and advancing high-impact commercial transformation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This individual will combine structured problem solving, data-driven insight generation, and cross-functional influence to accelerate growth, improve operational efficiency, and ensure accountability to transformational OKRs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Rhythm of the Business (RtB) operating model (e.g., QBR preparation, earnings support, dashboard development) while advancing carved-out workstreams and transformation-focused analyses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead efforts to gather, analyze, and interpret commercial performance data, customer insights, and market trends to identify actionable insights and synthesize at an executive level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop detailed fact bases and standardized assessment approach to formulate initial data-driven hypotheses to guide strategic discussions and decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create robust business cases and financial models to assess the feasibility, impact, and ROI of proposed transformation initiatives working closely with cross-functional stakeholders to validate assumptions, conduct sensitivity analysis, and present recommendations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
