&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Everpure Data Intelligence (formerly 1touch.io) helps enterprises discover, classify, and contextualize data across cloud, on-premises, and edge environments—improving AI accuracy, building trust in AI outcomes, and reducing risk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a Design Technical Architect – Data Management at Everpure, you will architect solutions that help the world&#39;s largest financial services, healthcare, and technology organizations discover, classify, and secure their data using the Inventa platform. You will serve as the strategic technical authority, transforming complex enterprise data footprints into clear, secure architectures that improve AI accuracy and mitigate data risk. Partnering closely with Sales, Customer Success, and Product teams, you will turn complex customer business needs into measurable data governance outcomes, acting as a crucial technical bridge for our global clients&lt;/div&gt;
