&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Complex Technical Integrations:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Guide enterprise customers through data infrastructure mapping by seamlessly connecting the platform to on-premises databases, file servers, cloud storage, SaaS applications, and data lakes via robust API designs.&lt;/li&gt;
