&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Cross-Organizational Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct end-to-end communication, status transparency, and dependency tracking across engineering, product management, infrastructure, and executive leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
