&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mitigate Systemic Risks:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify technical bottlenecks, critical path dependencies, and cross-team impediments—exercising independent judgment to establish effective resolution frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Process Evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a change agent by establishing scalable methodologies, automation tools, and program management frameworks that streamline time-to-market across the business unit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
