&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated mastery in leading complex, multi-component engineering programs across software, hardware, distributed systems, or virtualized/cloud infrastructure environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent ability to create structure and drive execution in ambiguous environments, navigating unknowns, resolving complex dependencies, and holding teams accountable for results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Delivery Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven capability in driving complex initiatives through every stage of the software/product development lifecycle (SDLC) while navigating multi-team dependencies and ambiguous challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep technical ability to understand distributed systems, triage technical risks, and facilitate in-depth discussions with engineers (without needing to be a software developer).&lt;/li&gt;
